      "response": "<h2>Settings</h2>\n\n<bl-switch id=\"notifications\">Email notifications</bl-switch>\n<p>Get notified when someone replies to your posts.</p>\n\n<bl-switch id=\"darkMode\" checked>Dark mode</bl-switch>\n<p>Use a dark color scheme across the whole app.</p>\n\n<bl-switch id=\"twoFactor\" disabled>Two-factor authentication</bl-switch>\n<p>Require a second verification step when you sign in.</p>\n\n<bl-select name=\"language\" label=\"Language\" placeholder=\"Choose a language\" help-text=\"The language used across the app.\">\n  <bl-select-option value=\"en\" label=\"English\"></bl-select-option>\n  <bl-select-option value=\"tr\" label=\"Turkish\"></bl-select-option>\n  <bl-select-option value=\"de\" label=\"German\"></bl-select-option>\n</bl-select>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('bl-switch').forEach((sw) => {\n    sw.addEventListener('bl-switch-toggle', (e) => {\n      console.log(`${sw.id} -> ${e.detail}`);\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n",
