      "sample": 2,
      "response": "<main>\n  <h2>Settings</h2>\n\n  <section>\n    <h3>Language</h3>\n    <p>Choose the interface language used across the app.</p>\n    <bl-select\n      label=\"Language\"\n      name=\"language\"\n      value=\"en\"\n      help-text=\"Applied to the whole application.\">\n      <bl-select-option value=\"en\" label=\"English\">English</bl-select-option>\n      <bl-select-option value=\"tr\" label=\"Türkçe\">Türkçe</bl-select-option>\n      <bl-select-option value=\"de\" label=\"Deutsch\">Deutsch</bl-select-option>\n    </bl-select>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h3>Notifications</h3>\n    <p>Decide how the app should reach you.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n        <bl-switch checked>Email alerts\n          <span class=\"hint\">Get updates about your account and security.</span>\n        </bl-switch>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <bl-switch>Push notifications\n          <span class=\"hint\">Instant alerts on this device.</span>\n        </bl-switch>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <bl-switch checked>Weekly digest\n          <span class=\"hint\">A short summary delivered every Monday.</span>\n        </bl-switch>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h3>Appearance</h3>\n    <p>Customize how the app looks and behaves.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n        <bl-switch>Dark mode\n          <span class=\"hint\">Reduce glare in low-light environments.</span>\n        </bl-switch>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <bl-switch checked>Reduce motion\n          <span class=\"hint\">Minimize animations across the app.</span>\n        </bl-switch>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n</main>\n",
